  "description": "The module SDK seam (platform RFC D1): the admin-surface contract every Goldpath module — first-party or product — composes from. The fail-closed ops floor (AdminSurfaceGuard), tenant scoping per admin-contract R1 (AdminTenantScope), the frozen paging clamp (AdminPaging), and trace links for work born off-request (TraceLink). Out-of-repo product modules bind HERE instead of copying source.",
